    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      491.14,
      536.69,
      683.38
    ],
    "text": "The atmospheric conditions are getting favorable for afternoon thundershowers in most parts of the island during next few days. Showers or thundershowers may occur at several places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, North- western, Central and Uva provinces and in Galle and Matara districts during the evening or night. Fairly heavy falls above 75mm are likely at some places. Misty conditions may prevail in most parts of the island during the early hours of the morning. The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
